          "settings": {
            "html": "<section data-stage=\"peking\" class=\"sec hero hero-sub\">\n<div class=\"hero-text\">\n<h1 class=\"h1 rise\">Kurzy <span class=\"nw\">tchaj-ťi</span> a <span class=\"nw\">čchi-kungu:</span> rozvrh a ceny</h1>\n\n<p class=\"body rise d2\">Výuka probíhá formou lekcí 90 minut nebo 120 minut, cvičíme v tělocvičně a v létě venku. Lekce jsou buď zaměřeny na čchi-kung, nebo tchaj-ťi.</p>\n<div class=\"actions rise d3\"><nav aria-label=\"Na této stránce\" class=\"actions\"><a href=\"#praha\" class=\"more\">Praha 4 <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#zlin\" class=\"more\">Zlín <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#cena\" class=\"more\">Ceny lekcí <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a></nav></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section>"
          },
