            "html": "<section id=\"misto\" data-stage=\"svitek\" aria-labelledby=\"misto-h\" class=\"sec\">\n<div class=\"sec-head\">\n<h2 id=\"misto-h\" class=\"h2 reveal\">Kde cvičíme: Praha 4 a Zlín</h2>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"stack-l\">\n<div class=\"media reveal\"><div data-tk-map-box data-src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Jeremenkova%201003%2F66A%2C%20Praha%204&amp;t=m&amp;z=16&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near\" data-title=\"Mapa – Tělocvična ZŠ Jeremenkova, Jeremenkova 1003/66A, Praha 4\" class=\"tk-map\">\n<span class=\"tk-map-pin\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5a7 7 0 0 1 14 0C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></circle></svg></span>\n<button type=\"button\" data-tk-map class=\"btn btn-primary\">Zobrazit mapu</button>\n<span class=\"tk-map-note\">Mapu načteme od Google až po kliknutí. <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Jeremenkova%201003%2F66A%2C%20Praha%204\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"tk-map-link\">Otevřít v Google Maps</a></span>\n</div><p><strong>Tělocvična ZŠ Jeremenkova</strong><br><span class=\"muted\">Jeremenkova 1003/66A, 147 00 Praha 4</span></p></div>\n<div class=\"media reveal\"><div data-tk-map-box data-src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Osvoboditel%C5%AF%20484%2C%20Zl%C3%ADn&amp;t=m&amp;z=16&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near\" data-title=\"Mapa – Centrum Jiný svět, Osvoboditelů 484, Zlín\" class=\"tk-map\">\n<span class=\"tk-map-pin\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5a7 7 0 0 1 14 0C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-w